\"page_link\":null,\"heading_link\":null,\"sort_order\":5,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-05T07:56:45.653000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-05T07:56:45.653000Z\",\"event_date\":null,\"class_name\":null,\"heading\":null,\"content\":null,\"redirect_url\":null,\"image_link\":null,\"class_id\":null}]},{\"id\":460,\"heading\":\"DPS ELDECO\\u2019S KARATE CHAMPIONS MAKE HISTORY! \\ud83c\\udfc6\",\"content\":\"<p>Proud Moments at the 3rd WMSKF All India Karate Championship 2026!<\\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Our young champions brought glory to DPS Eldeco with their outstanding performances at K.D. Singh Babu Stadium, Lucknow! \\ud83e\\udd4b\\u2728<\\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\ud83e\\udd47 Gold Medal Winners<br>&bull; Diarra Mohan (Class III-F) &ndash; Kata<br>&bull; Daivik (Class III-C) &ndash; Kumite<br>&bull; Nandini Sharma (Class III-E) &ndash; Kata &amp; Kumite<\\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\ud83e\\udd48 Silver Medal Winners<br>&bull; Prakriti Dubey (Class IV-C) &ndash; Kata<br>&bull; Jaisnavi Singh (Class V-E) &ndash; Kata<br>&bull; Sanchaya Rajput (Class V-B) &ndash; Kata<br>&bull; Khush Pandey (Class III-D) &ndash; Kata<\\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\ud83e\\udd49 Bronze Medal Winner<br>&bull; Ishanvi Singh (Class III-A) &ndash; Kata<\\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\ud83d\\udc4f Heartiest congratulations to all our young Karate Champions! Your dedication, discipline, and determination have made the entire DPS Eldeco family immensely proud. \\ud83c\\udf1f<\\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Keep shining, keep striving, and keep bringing laurels to DPS Eldeco! \\ud83c\\udfc6\\u2728<\\\/p>\",\"gallery_type\":\"achievements\",\"gallery_sub_type\":{\"id\":35,\"gallery_type\":\"achievements\",\"sub_type_name\":\"sport_academy_achievements\",\"description\":\"Sport Academy Achievements\",\"is_active\":true,\"sort_order\":0,\"created_at\":null,\"updated_at\":null},\"gallery_title\":\"DPS ELDECO\\u2019S KARATE CHAMPIONS MAKE HISTORY! ??\",\"gallery_slug\":\"dps-eldecos-karate-champions-make-history\",\"status\":\"active\",\"publish_status\":\"published\",\"sort_order\":0,\"pa